{"3454810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Poltergeist Prodigy", "steam_appid": 3454810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poltergeist Prodigy is a single-player, story-focused, puzzle action-adventure game, a first person haunter where you delight in being a mischievous ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/extras/71addc5137068d1565162919573f3266.poster.avif?t=1743584612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/extras/71addc5137068d1565162919573f3266.webm?t=1743584612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/extras/71addc5137068d1565162919573f3266.mp4?t=1743584612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new ghost, and to continue existing and uncover how you died you must haunt the living. With guidance from a comedic, more experienced ghost, you will learn to haunt people and animals with a variety of techniques in a range of places. By throwing objects around, conjuring scary aspects, possessing people, and ultilising many more haunting abilities, you will scare your way to becoming a more powerful spirit and trigger memories of how you died and the mysterious circumstances behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a short and compelling story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with everything. As a ghost you can move or otherwise manipulate everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move objects, summon ‘scary’ aspects, manipulate appliances, possess the living.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced, comedic guiding mentor teaches you how to haunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasingly cute, low-poly visuals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poltergeist Prodigy is a single-player, story-focused, puzzle action-adventure game, a first person haunter where you delight in being a mischievous ghost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/extras/71addc5137068d1565162919573f3266.poster.avif?t=1743584612\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/extras/71addc5137068d1565162919573f3266.webm?t=1743584612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/extras/71addc5137068d1565162919573f3266.mp4?t=1743584612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new ghost, and to continue existing and uncover how you died you must haunt the living. With guidance from a comedic, more experienced ghost, you will learn to haunt people and animals with a variety of techniques in a range of places. By throwing objects around, conjuring scary aspects, possessing people, and ultilising many more haunting abilities, you will scare your way to becoming a more powerful spirit and trigger memories of how you died and the mysterious circumstances behind it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a short and compelling story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with everything. As a ghost you can move or otherwise manipulate everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move objects, summon ‘scary’ aspects, manipulate appliances, possess the living.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced, comedic guiding mentor teaches you how to haunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasingly cute, low-poly visuals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are a new ghost, and to continue existing and uncover how you died you must haunt the living. Delight in being a mischievous ghost in this first person haunter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/header.jpg?t=1743584612", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/8163630bf558ab2c79cccc4d38e04e95440d63f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743584612", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454810/8163630bf558ab2c79cccc4d38e04e95440d63f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743584612", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 8800 GT, AMD 5670, Intel HD 3000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 10 series and above<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Poltergeist Prodigy Copyright Peacock Productions 2025", "developers": ["Greg Giddens"], "publishers": ["Peacock Pie Product